{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T19:58:13.142234", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the index of the item\n  item_idx = env.world.cookbook.index[item]\n  # Check if the item is craftable\n  if item_idx not in env.world.cookbook.recipes:\n      return []\n  # Get the recipe for the item\n  recipe = env.world.cookbook.recipes[item_idx]\n  # Get the workshop index\n  workshop_idx = env.world.cookbook.index[recipe['_at']]\n  # Check if we have all the required items to craft\n  for ingredient, count in recipe.items():\n      if ingredient == '_at':\n          continue\n      if env._current_state.inventory[env.world.cookbook.index[ingredient]] < count:\n          return []\n  # Now we need to go to the workshop\n  # Find the workshop location in the grid\n  workshop_pos = None\n  for i in range(env.world.world_size):\n      for j in range(env.world.world_size):\n          if env._current_state.grid[i, j, workshop_idx] > 0:\n              workshop_pos = (i, j)\n              break\n      if workshop_pos:\n          break\n  # If workshop not found, return empty list\n  if not workshop_pos:\n      return []\n  # Move to the workshop\n  # Calculate the direction to move\n  dx = workshop_pos[0] - env._current_state.pos[0]\n  dy = workshop_pos[1] - env._current_state.pos[1]\n  # Determine the direction to move\n  if dx < 0:\n      direction = 'UP'\n  elif dx > 0:\n      direction = 'DOWN'\n  elif dy < 0:\n      direction = 'LEFT'\n  elif dy > 0:\n      direction = 'RIGHT'\n  else:\n      direction = 'DOWN'  # Default if no movement needed\n  # Get the move action\n  action = env.action_specs()[direction]\n  # Return the move action and the USE action\n  return [action, 4]  # 4 is the index for USE action", "island_id": 9, "scores": {"3": -1}}
