{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T21:30:47.299315", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the recipe for the item\n  recipe = env.world.cookbook.recipes.get(item)\n  if recipe is None:\n      return []\n\n  # Check if we have all the ingredients\n  for ingredient, count in recipe.items():\n      if ingredient == \"_at\":\n          continue\n      if count > env.current_state.inventory[env.world.cookbook.index[ingredient]]:\n          return []\n\n  # Get the workshop location\n  workshop = recipe[\"_at\"]\n  workshop_idx = env.world.cookbook.index[workshop]\n\n  # Find the workshop coordinates\n  workshop_coords = np.where(env.current_state.grid[:, :, workshop_idx] > 0)\n  if len(workshop_coords[0]) == 0:\n      return []\n\n  # Calculate the difference\n  x, y = env.current_state.pos\n  workshop_x, workshop_y = workshop_coords[0][0], workshop_coords[1][0]\n  dx = workshop_x - x\n  dy = workshop_y - y\n\n  # Generate movement actions\n  actions = []\n  while dx != 0 or dy != 0:\n      if dx > 0:\n          actions.append(DOWN)\n          dx -= 1\n      elif dx < 0:\n          actions.append(UP)\n          dx += 1\n      if dy > 0:\n          actions.append(RIGHT)\n          dy -= 1\n      elif dy < 0:\n          actions.append(LEFT)\n          dy += 1\n\n  # Use the workshop\n  actions.append(USE)\n\n  return actions", "island_id": 5, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
