{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T21:43:32.377466", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Here is the implementation of `craft_v2` to be filled.\n  # We have provided some helper functions as follows:\n  #   - get_primitive_recipes(item): returns a dict mapping from primitive item to the number of required.\n  #   - get_workshop(item): returns the workshop where the item can be crafted.\n  #   - get_primitive(item): returns True if the item is a primitive.\n  #   - get_recipe(item): returns the recipe for the item.\n\n  # For example:\n  #   get_primitive_recipes(\"PLANK\") returns {\"WOOD\": 1}\n  #   get_workshop(\"PLANK\") returns \"WORKSHOP0\"\n  #   get_primitive(\"PLANK\") returns False\n  #   get_recipe(\"PLANK\") returns {\"WOOD\": 1, \"_at\": \"WORKSHOP0\"}\n  return []", "island_id": 1, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
