{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T23:23:48.651860", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Your code here\n  # Remember to return a list of action indices.\n  # You can use the following methods to help you:\n  #   - env.world.cookbook.recipes: dict of recipes.\n  #   - env.world.cookbook.index: Index instance mapping names to integer IDs.\n  #   - env.world.cookbook.primitives: set of primitive kinds.\n  #   - env.world.cookbook.kinds: set of all kinds.\n  #   - env.world.cookbook.n_kinds: total number of kinds.\n  #   - env.world.cookbook.primitives_for(goal): returns a dict of primitives required.\n  #   - env.world.cookbook.environment: set of environment kinds.\n  #   - env.world.workshop_indices: list of indices for workshop locations.\n  #   - env.world.non_grabbable_indices: set of non-grabbable indices.\n  #   - env.world.grabbable_indices: list of grabbable indices.\n  #   - env.world.water_index: index for water.\n  #   - env.world.stone_index: index for stone.\n  #   - env.world.random: random number generator.\n  #   - env._current_state: current state of the environment.\n  #   - env._current_state.grid: grid of the environment.\n  #   - env._current_state.pos: current position of the agent.\n  #   - env._current_state.dir: current direction of the agent.\n  #   - env._current_state.inventory: current inventory of the agent.\n  #   - env._current_state.next_to(i_kind): returns True if next to i_kind.\n  #   - env._current_state.satisfies(goal_name, goal_arg): returns True if inventory contains goal_arg.\n  #   - env._current_state.features(): returns the features of the current state.\n  #   - env._current_state.features_dict(): returns the features dictionary of the current state.\n  #   - env._current_state.step(action): steps the environment with the given action.\n\n  return []", "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
