{"timestamp": "2025-09-13T22:45:25.158096", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Check if item is craftable\n  if not env.world.cookbook.recipes.get(item):\n      return []\n\n  # Get the recipe for the item\n  recipe = env.world.cookbook.recipes[item]\n\n  # Get the workshop index for crafting\n  workshop = recipe[\"_at\"]\n  workshop_index = env.world.workshop_indices[workshop]\n\n  # Check if the agent has all the required ingredients\n  has_all = True\n  for ingredient, count in recipe.items():\n      if ingredient == \"_at\":\n          continue\n      # Check if the agent has enough of the ingredient\n      if env._current_state.inventory[ingredient] < count:\n          has_all = False\n          break\n\n  if not has_all:\n      return []\n\n  # Go to the workshop and craft\n  actions = []\n  # Calculate the position of the workshop\n  workshop_pos = None\n  for i in range(env.world.world_size):\n      for j in range(env.world.world_size):\n          if env._current_state.grid[i, j, workshop_index] > 0:\n              workshop_pos = (i, j)\n              break\n      if workshop_pos:\n          break\n\n  if workshop_pos is None:\n      return []\n\n  # Move to the workshop\n  # ... (code to move to workshop_pos)\n\n  # Craft the item (use)\n  actions.append(USE)\n\n  return actions", "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
