{"timestamp": "2025-09-13T23:08:52.800634", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Check if the item is in the environment's cookbook.\n  # If it isn't, return an empty list.\n  if item not in env.world.cookbook.index:\n      return []\n  \n  # Get the recipe for the item.\n  recipe = env.world.cookbook.recipes[env.world.cookbook.index[item]]\n  \n  # Check if the agent has all the required items.\n  # If not, return an empty list.\n  if not all(env._current_state.inventory[env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]] > 0 for primitive in recipe if primitive != '_at'):\n      return []\n  \n  # Get the workshop where the item can be crafted.\n  workshop = recipe['_at']\n  \n  # Get the workshop index.\n  workshop_index = env.world.workshop_indices[env.world.cookbook.index[workshop]]\n  \n  # Get the position of the workshop.\n  workshop_pos = None\n  for i in range(env.world.world.shape[0]):\n      for j in range(env.world.world.shape[1]):\n          if env.world.world[i, j, workshop_index] > 0:\n              workshop_pos = (i, j)\n              break\n      if workshop_pos:\n          break\n  \n  # If workshop is not found, return an empty list.\n  if workshop_pos is None:\n      return []\n  \n  # Calculate the direction to face the workshop.\n  direction = None\n  if workshop_pos[0] > env._current_state.pos[0]:\n      direction = 'DOWN'\n  elif workshop_pos[0] < env._current_state.pos[0]:\n      direction = 'UP'\n  elif workshop_pos[1] > env._current_state.pos[1]:\n      direction = 'RIGHT'\n  elif workshop_pos[1] < env._current_state.pos[1]:\n      direction = 'LEFT'\n  \n  # If direction is not found, return an empty list.\n  if direction is None:\n      return []\n  \n  # Move to the workshop.\n  actions = []\n  if direction == 'UP':\n      actions.append(1)  # UP\n  elif direction == 'DOWN':\n      actions.append(0)  # DOWN\n  elif direction == 'LEFT':\n      actions.append(2)  # LEFT\n  elif direction == 'RIGHT':\n      actions.append(3)  # RIGHT\n  \n  # Perform the USE action.\n  actions.append(4)  # USE\n  \n  return actions", "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": -1}}
