{"timestamp": "2025-09-13T23:14:10.572289", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Check if the item is in the cookbook\n  # If not, return empty list\n  # Get the recipe for the item from the cookbook\n  # Get the workshop location for the recipe\n  # Check if we have all the required ingredients for the recipe\n  # If not, return empty list\n  # If we have all the required ingredients, then:\n  #   - Go to the workshop location (by moving to the workshop)\n  #   - Perform the USE action at the workshop\n  # Return the list of actions to craft the item\n\n  # Note: The recipe is stored in env.world.cookbook.recipes\n  # The workshop location is stored in recipe['_at']\n  # The required ingredients are stored in recipe (with keys being the ingredient names)\n  # The index of the workshop location can be obtained from env.world.workshop_indices\n  # The index of the ingredients can be obtained from env.world.cookbook.index\n\n  return []", "island_id": 0, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
