{"timestamp": "2025-09-14T00:13:34.473258", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # We will be using the following functions from the environment\n  # - env.world.cookbook.recipes: the recipe dictionary\n  # - env.world.cookbook.primitives_for(goal): returns the primitive requirements for the goal\n  # - env.world.cookbook.index.get(goal): returns the index of the goal item\n  # - env.world.cookbook.index.get('workshop0'): returns the index of workshop0\n  # - env.world.cookbook.index.get('workshop1'): returns the index of workshop1\n  # - env.world.cookbook.index.get('workshop2'): returns the index of workshop2\n  # - env.world.cookbook.index.get('stone'): returns the index of stone (or any primitive)\n  # - env.world.non_grabbable_indices: set of non-grabbable indices (e.g., workshop0, workshop1, workshop2)\n  # - env.world.grabbable_indices: list of grabbable indices (e.g., stone, wood, etc.)\n  # - env.world.workshop_indices: list of indices for workshop locations (e.g., [workshop0, workshop1, workshop2])\n  # - env.world.water_index: index for water\n  # - env.world.stone_index: index for stone\n  # - env.current_state: the current state of the environment (a CraftState instance)\n  # - env.current_state.inventory: the current inventory of the agent\n  # - env.current_state.features_dict: the current features of the environment\n  # - env.current_state.pos: the current position of the agent\n  # - env.current_state.dir: the current direction of the agent\n  # - env.current_state.next_to(i_kind): checks if the agent is next to the item with index i_kind\n  # - env.current_state.satisfies(goal_name, goal_arg): checks if the inventory has the goal item\n\n  # Implement the logic for craft_v2 here\n  return []", "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
